<accept> The text explicitly states that "Cognitive benefits were observed even for those who had substantial levels of neurodegenerative pathologies" and that lifestyle interventions had a positive impact "even for those with Alzheimer’s and other neurodegenerative pathologies in their brains," indicating that the benefits apply even after these conditions are present. </accept>

